   "fix": "In section Rings add `@[simp\u2193] theorem map_rankOnePoints {R : Type*} [CommRing R] (f : K \u2192+* R) (g : SL(2, K)) : (pointsPresentation K).map (pointsPresentation R) f (rankOnePoints K i g) = rankOnePoints R i (Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.map f g)`, proved by `Subtype.ext` + `IntegralPointsPresentation.coe_map`, `coe_rankOnePoints` and `weightTable.map_sl2BlockSL` (importing `D4.Tripled.PointsFunctor`), and list it in Main declarations.",
   "issue": "`rankOnePoints` has no lemma for how it behaves under a ring homomorphism, unlike the E7 version (`map_rankOnePoints`, `@[simp\u2193]`) and this carrier's own `map_rootSubgroupPoints`/`map_weightTorusPoints`. Without it, the L5 consumer, which must commute with ring maps, has to unfold `rankOnePoints`.",
